<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Xenogerm Trader Stock -->
  <XTS_SettingsCategory>贸易商异种胚芽库存</XTS_SettingsCategory>

  <!-- EN: Xenotypes for sale -->
  <XTS_XenotypesSection>在售异种人</XTS_XenotypesSection>
  <!-- EN: Archite xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterArchite>超凡异种人</XTS_FilterArchite>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotypes with archite genes, such as sanguophages. Scenario xenotypes are grouped separately. -->
  <XTS_FilterArchiteDesc>含有超凡基因的预设异种人，例如赫血种。剧本异种人另行分组。</XTS_FilterArchiteDesc>
  <!-- EN: Germline xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterInheritable>系谱异种人</XTS_FilterInheritable>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotypes whose genes are passed on to children, such as impids and yttakin. The baseliner xenogerm is listed here too, because it turns a person back into a baseliner. -->
  <XTS_FilterInheritableDesc>基因会遗传给子女的预设异种人，例如炎魔种和毛绒种。智人种异种胚芽也列在此处，因为它能将人转化回智人种。</XTS_FilterInheritableDesc>
  <!-- EN: Scenario xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterPlayerScenario>剧本异种人</XTS_FilterPlayerScenario>
  <!-- EN: The custom xenotypes your starting colonists were created with. Xenotypes you assemble during the game will never be sold. -->
  <XTS_FilterPlayerScenarioDesc>你的初始殖民者所使用的自定义异种人。游戏中自行组装的异种人不会被出售。</XTS_FilterPlayerScenarioDesc>
  <!-- EN: No sellable xenotypes are loaded. -->
  <XTS_NoXenotypes>未加载任何可出售的异种人。</XTS_NoXenotypes>
  <!-- EN: Base xenogerm -->
  <XTS_PriceBase>基础异种胚芽</XTS_PriceBase>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotype -->
  <XTS_PricePreset>预设异种人</XTS_PricePreset>
  <!-- EN: Scenario xenotype -->
  <XTS_PriceScenario>剧本异种人</XTS_PriceScenario>
  <!-- EN: Metabolism {0} × {1} -->
  <XTS_PriceMetabolism>代谢率 {0} × {1}</XTS_PriceMetabolism>
  <!-- EN: Complexity {0} × {1} -->
  <XTS_PriceComplexity>复杂度 {0} × {1}</XTS_PriceComplexity>
  <!-- EN: Archite genes {0} × {1} -->
  <XTS_PriceArchite>超凡基因 {0} × {1}</XTS_PriceArchite>
  <!-- EN: Contains archite genes -->
  <XTS_XenotypeArchite>含有超凡基因</XTS_XenotypeArchite>
  <!-- EN: Contains germline genes -->
  <XTS_XenotypeEndogenes>含有系谱基因</XTS_XenotypeEndogenes>
  <!-- EN: Contains xenogenes -->
  <XTS_XenotypeXenogenes>含有异种基因</XTS_XenotypeXenogenes>
  <!-- EN: A custom xenotype your starting colonists were created with. -->
  <XTS_CustomXenotypeDesc>你的初始殖民者所使用的自定义异种人。</XTS_CustomXenotypeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Scenario -->
  <XTS_XenotypeSourceScenario>剧本</XTS_XenotypeSourceScenario>

  <!-- EN: Xenogerm pricing -->
  <XTS_PricingSection>异种胚芽定价</XTS_PricingSection>
  <!-- EN: The market value of xenogerms sold by traders. -->
  <XTS_PricingSectionDesc>贸易商出售的异种胚芽的市场价值。</XTS_PricingSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Base preset value: {0} -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValue>预设基础价值: {0}</XTS_BasePresetValue>
  <!-- EN: The silver added to the market value of every xenogerm sold by traders. -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>贸易商出售的每个异种胚芽，市场价值都会增加这些白银。</XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per metabolism: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>每点代谢率价值: {0}</XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>
  <!-- EN: The silver added for each point of metabolic efficiency, positive or negative. -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>每点代谢率增加的白银，无论正负。</XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per complexity: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexity>每点复杂度价值: {0}</XTS_ValuePerComplexity>
  <!-- EN: The silver added for each point of complexity. -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>每点复杂度增加的白银。</XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per archite gene: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchite>每个超凡基因价值: {0}</XTS_ValuePerArchite>
  <!-- EN: The silver added for each archite gene. -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>每个超凡基因增加的白银。</XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>

  <!-- EN: Stock quantity -->
  <XTS_QuantitySection>库存数量</XTS_QuantitySection>
  <!-- EN: The number of xenogerms each kind of trader will stock, picked at random from its range. -->
  <XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>每种贸易商出售的异种胚芽数量，在其范围内随机选取。</XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: {0}: {1}~{2} -->
  <XTS_TraderCount>{0}: {1}~{2}</XTS_TraderCount>
  <!-- EN: {0} (orbital) -->
  <XTS_TraderOrbital>{0}（轨道）</XTS_TraderOrbital>
  <!-- EN: {0} (caravan) -->
  <XTS_TraderCaravan>{0}（远行队）</XTS_TraderCaravan>
  <!-- EN: {0} settlements -->
  <XTS_TraderSettlement>{0}定居点</XTS_TraderSettlement>
  <!-- EN: The number of xenogerms this trader will arrive with. -->
  <XTS_TraderCountDesc>该贸易商到访时携带的异种胚芽数量。</XTS_TraderCountDesc>
  <!-- EN: The number of xenogerms these settlements will keep in stock. Settlements restock about once a month. -->
  <XTS_SettlementCountDesc>这些定居点库存中的异种胚芽数量。定居点约每月补货一次。</XTS_SettlementCountDesc>

  <!-- EN: Implantation -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSection>植入</XTS_ImplantationSection>
  <!-- EN: How xenogerms behave when implanted. -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>异种胚芽植入时的表现。</XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Germline xenogerms replace germline genes -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>系谱异种胚芽替换系谱基因</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>
  <!-- EN: Keep deathrest capacity -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>保留死眠容量</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, a person will keep the deathrest capacity gained from serums when a xenogerm is implanted, as long as they still have the deathrest gene. When disabled, their deathrest capacity will reset to one. -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>启用后，植入异种胚芽时，只要此人仍拥有死眠基因，就会保留通过血清获得的死眠容量。禁用后，其死眠容量会重置为1。</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, a xenogerm for a germline xenotype will replace the person's germline genes, and their children will inherit them. Their existing xenogenes will be kept. When disabled, the genes will be implanted as xenogenes and will overwrite the existing ones. -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>启用后，系谱异种人的异种胚芽会替换此人的系谱基因，其子女将遗传这些基因，原有的异种基因会被保留。禁用后，这些基因会作为异种基因植入，并覆盖原有的异种基因。</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>

  <!-- EN: Xenotype rarity by price -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySection>稀有度取决于价格</XTS_CommonalitySection>
  <!-- EN: How the price of a xenogerm changes the chance that a trader will stock it. -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>异种胚芽的价格如何影响贸易商出售它的几率。</XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePrice>反比</XTS_StrategyInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms will be much more common. Archite xenogerms will stay rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>更便宜的异种胚芽会常见得多。超凡异种胚芽依然罕见。</XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse root -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>平方根反比</XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms will be somewhat more common. -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>更便宜的异种胚芽会稍微更常见。</XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Linear -->
  <XTS_StrategyPrice>线性</XTS_StrategyPrice>
  <!-- EN: More expensive xenogerms will be much more common. -->
  <XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>更昂贵的异种胚芽会常见得多。</XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Square root -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>平方根</XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>
  <!-- EN: More expensive xenogerms will be somewhat more common. -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>更昂贵的异种胚芽会稍微更常见。</XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Bell curve -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurve>钟形曲线</XTS_StrategyBellCurve>
  <!-- EN: Xenogerms near the median price will be the most common. The cheapest and the most expensive will both be rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>价格接近中位数的异种胚芽最为常见，最便宜和最昂贵的都很罕见。</XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>
  <!-- EN: Uniform -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniform>均匀</XTS_StrategyUniform>
  <!-- EN: Every sellable xenotype is equally likely, regardless of price. -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>无论价格高低，每种可出售的异种人被选中的概率都相同。</XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>

  <!-- EN:  (default) -->
  <XTS_DefaultSuffix>（默认）</XTS_DefaultSuffix>

</LanguageData>
